@startuml avs-architecture-boundaries
title AVS Architecture Boundaries (CR-VAS-008)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Value Boundary\nWhere realization begins/ends" as VB
rectangle "Agentic Boundary\nWhere agentic participation occurs" as AB
rectangle "Authority Boundary\nWhat may/may not decide or execute" as AUB
rectangle "Technology Boundary\nWhich systems implement realization" as TB

VB -[hidden]- AB
AB -[hidden]- AUB
AUB -[hidden]- TB

note bottom
  Every AVS architecture SHOULD identify
  these four boundaries. The technology
  boundary sits inside the value boundary,
  which sits inside the agentic boundary,
  which sits inside the authority boundary.
end note

@enduml
